<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .header-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .sub-header {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14pt;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .rule-list li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <div style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold;">Shoreline</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">COMMUNITY COLLEGE</div>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">State Employee</div>
    <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">Space Available</div>
    <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">Tuition Waiver Form</div>
  </div>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div>
      <label for="quarter_year">Quarter/Year:</label>
      <span data-field="quarter_year" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; display: inline-block; width: 200px;">{{ quarter_year }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="date">Date:</label>
      <span data-field="date" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; display: inline-block; width: 200px;">{{ date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Note: See addendum page for program regulations.</p>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Student Name:</td>
      <td style="width: 80%;"><span data-field="student_name">{{ student_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Address:</td>
      <td><span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>City:</td>
      <td><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span></td>
      <td>State:</td>
      <td><span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span></td>
      <td>ZIP:</td>
      <td><span data-field="zip">{{ zip }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Home Phone:</td>
      <td><span data-field="home_phone">{{ home_phone }}</span></td>
      <td>Email:</td>
      <td><span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Name of Agency:</td>
      <td><span data-field="agency_name">{{ agency_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Job Title:</td>
      <td><span data-field="job_title">{{ job_title }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Work Phone:</td>
      <td><span data-field="work_phone">{{ work_phone }}</span></td>
      <td>SCAN Phone:</td>
      <td><span data-field="scan_phone">{{ scan_phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Signature:</td>
      <td><span data-field="signature">{{ signature }}</span></td>
      <td>Date:</td>
      <td><span data-field="signature_date">{{ signature_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div class="section-title">To Be Completed By Employee's Personnel Office:</div>
    <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;">I certify that:</td>
        <td style="width: 80%;"><span data-field="certification_statement">{{ certification_statement }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Is employed by:</td>
        <td><span data-field="employed_by">{{ employed_by }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>And holds the position of:</td>
        <td><span data-field="position_held">{{ position_held }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">THIS INDIVIDUAL is a full-time or part-time permanent, classified state employee mer- ber as defined in chapters 28B.16 and 41.06 RCW.</p>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Name of Human Resources Representative:</td>
      <td style="width: 80%;"><span data-field="hr_representative_name">{{ hr_representative_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Address:</td>
      <td><span data-field="hr_address">{{ hr_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>City:</td>
      <td><span data-field="hr_city">{{ hr_city }}</span></td>
      <td>State:</td>
      <td><span data-field="hr_state">{{ hr_state }}</span></td>
      <td>ZIP:</td>
      <td><span data-field="hr_zip">{{ hr_zip }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Work Phone:</td>
      <td><span data-field="hr_work_phone">{{ hr_work_phone }}</span></td>
      <td>SCAN Phone:</td>
      <td><span data-field="hr_scan_phone">{{ hr_scan_phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Email:</td>
      <td><span data-field="hr_email">{{ hr_email }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Signature of Human Resources Representative:</td>
      <td><span data-field="hr_signature">{{ hr_signature }}</span></td>
      <td>Date:</td>
      <td><span data-field="hr_date">{{ hr_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Space is available in this class FOLLOWING the 6th day of instruction. (4th day summer qtr.)</p>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;">Item Number:</td>
        <td style="width: 50%;">Course Title:</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Instructor:</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in class_schedule %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="class_schedule[{{ loop.index0 }}].item_number">{{ class_schedule[loop.index0].item_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="class_schedule[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_title">{{ class_schedule[loop.index0].course_title }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="class_schedule[{{ loop.index0 }}].instructor">{{ class_schedule[loop.index0].instructor }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <div style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold;">Shoreline</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">COMMUNITY COLLEGE</div>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">State Employee</div>
    <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">Space-Available</div>
    <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">TUITION WAIVER PROGRAM</div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">PROGRAM REGULATIONS</div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <ul class="rule-list">
      <li>1. This program is limited to permanent half- time or more state employees as defined by RCW 41.06 and 25B.15.558. To determine if you are eligible, consult your HR repre- sentative.</li>
      <li>2. Space is considered to be available if AF- TER the 5th day of a full quarter class, en- rollment in the class is less than the capac- ity requirement. Students interested in this program may consult with the instructor about sitting in on the class while waiting to determine if space will become avail- able.</li>
      <li>3. Individuals interested in participating in this program will not be permitted to enroll on a regular basis and then drop the class in order to create available space. Registration prior to the sixth day of the class will dis- qualify the student from using the waiver for that class.</li>
      <li>4. If space is available (as defined by item 2), have the instructor sign the front of this form. Take the completed form with a reg- istration form to the Registration Office.</li>
      <li>5. A registration fee of $20 per quarter shall be charged to partially recover the cost of admitting, registering, and maintaining aca- demic records for students participating in this program. Parking fees, computer lab fees and other special class fees will not be waived.</li>
      <li>6. The first quarter a student takes a class for credit at Shoreline Community College, he or she is required to complete an admis- sions application.</li>
      <li>7. Under this program, state employees are eligible to register part time (1-6 credits).</li>
      <li>8. Only state supported courses are available under this program.</li>
      <li>9. State employees enrolled under this pro- gram must meet standard course prerequi- sites and college math and English assess- ment test requirements.</li>
      <li>10. We encourage you to make a copy of this form for your records and provide a copy for your employer.</li>
      <li>11. State employees using this tuition waiver must register by the end of the fourth week of the quarter. No registration will be per- mitted after the fourth week of the quarter.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>